# Analects Book 9 (子罕) — draft, first half: lemmata 0–21 = passages 9.1–9.11. Token format as the pilot:
#   tokens separated by " | "; a token is  CHARS[PUNCT][=pinyin][/context gloss[//char gloss//char gloss]]
#   a leading "^" breaks the verse line before the token.
# Punctuation is editorial (the edition has none) and always trails the word before it.
# Pinyin defaults to the glossary's first reading; every polyphone states its reading here, and so does
# every character not yet in the glossary.
# Passage numbering follows Zhu Xi's chapter breaks (凡三十章; the ○ marks confirm the brief's list):
# 9.2 runs over two units, 9.3 over two, 9.5 over three, 9.6 over four (牢曰 at unit 12 is printed in
# 9.6; Zhu Xi quotes Wu that the disciples recorded it with the Master's words because it was close in
# sense), 9.10 over three, 9.11 over three.
# Misprints corrected in the reading text (rule 5b; emend.json entries present): unit 8 (9.5) the print
# has 如子何 for 如予何; unit 21 (9.11) the print has 𦵏子死 for 𦵏予死.
# Quotation marks balance within every unit. Where a speech runs on past one of Zhu Xi's comments (9.3
# unit 3, 9.5 unit 7, 9.10 unit 16, 9.11 unit 20) the first unit closes the quotation and the
# continuation is left unquoted, Chinese and English alike (as Book 8).
# Glyphs kept as the edition prints them: 兹, 旣 (9.5) and 既 (9.10) both, 髙, 鑚, 顔, 絶, 衆, 𦵏
# (U+26D4F, = 葬, read zàng), 已 (9.8 吾已矣夫, 9.10 末由也已; yǐ).
# New bound compounds (need glossary entries): 達巷 (a place name, Zhu Xi: 黨名), 文王, 大宰 (tài zǎi,
# a title, as 大師/大廟), 齊衰 (zī cuī), 空空, 喟然, 循循, 卓爾 (descriptive binomes, bound like 斐然,
# 申申, 戰戰). Not bound: 門 | 弟子 (as 8.3), 匡 | 人, 鄙 | 夫, 鳳 | 鳥, 衣 | 裳, 鄙 | 事, 道 | 路,
# 無 | 寧, 大 | 𦵏.
# Readings: 大 tài in 大宰 (Zhu Xi: 大音泰); 與 yù 'take part in' (9.5, Zhu Xi: 喪與並去聲), yú (9.6,
# 平聲), yǔ (9.1 'and', 9.9 'and', 9.11 與其); 喪 sàng (去聲); 少 shào (9.6; 9.9 少去聲); 齊衰 zī cuī
# (齊音咨，衰七雷反); 夫 fú (9.8, 音扶); 喟 kuì (苦位反); 鑚 zuān (祖官反); 閒 jiàn (9.11 病閒; Zhu Xi
# marks 如字, the level-tone jiān; modern practice reads 病間 jiàn and so do we — the note says so);
# 叩 kòu (Zhu Xi: 音口, kǒu; modern kòu — the note says so). Stated though Zhu Xi gives no note: 將
# jiāng, 見 jiàn, 衣 yī (noun: Zhu Xi 衣上服), 為 wéi, 行 xíng, 從 cóng, 沒 mò, 知 zhī, 予 yú, 寧 nìng,
# 縱 zòng, 約 yuē, 趨 qū.
# Collation (He Yan's SBCK text, KR1h0005): noted where it bears on the sense — 9.6 大宰知我者乎 (adds
# 者); 9.9 雖少者必作 (adds 者); 9.10 未由也巳 (未 for 末). Not noted (graphic or a particle that changes
# nothing): 9.3 上㤗 without 也; 9.5 天之未喪斯文 without 也; 9.6 太宰; 9.8 巳; 9.10 㫆, 間.

